WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.630
On iPhone, Today shows what's waiting
for review and your recent encounters.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.590
Tap the workspace button to switch between
your personal workspace and your practice.

00:00:10.113 --> 00:00:12.343
Open Patients and search by name.

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:15.463
Tap a patient to see
every visit, newest first.

00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:17.783
Team settings and global
search are on the web.
